  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Symbiose Éducateur Canin is first and foremost a dog training centre, based in La Cadière d'Azur and covering the whole area between Toulon, La Seyne-sur-Mer, Sanary-sur-Mer, Six-Fours-les-Plages and La Ciotat. Dog boarding — short and long stays — is offered there as a complementary service to training, not as the main activity.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The advertised facilities include a play room, an outdoor space, air-conditioned rooms and walks by the sea or in the forest. This information comes from the official website symbioseeducateurcanin.fr, consistent and detailed on its dedicated pages, but it has not yet been cross-checked by an independent source. Prices have not been extracted to date despite dedicated pages existing on the site.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: since boarding is a secondary service here, check availability and the admission conditions carefully before booking, especially if you're only looking for boarding without the training side.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Bandol vineyards and the coves along the coast between Sanary-sur-Mer and La Ciotat are accessible from La Cadière d'Azur.</p>
